# Anthropic Claude AI API Configuration
#
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Copy this file and rename it to ".env" (remove .example)
# 2. Get your API key from: https://console.anthropic.com/
# 3. Replace "your_api_key_here" with your actual API key
# 4. NEVER commit the .env file to GitHub - it's already in .gitignore
#
# Example:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
